00:59:19,832 --> 00:59:21,707
And a little pepper.

708
00:59:24,999 --> 00:59:26,665
Aha.

709
00:59:27,749 --> 00:59:31,874
- Alright, all done!
- Hold on! He still wanted... Atoll.

710
00:59:32,666 --> 00:59:34,832
- Our aioli.
- Double-Atoll.

711
00:59:34,916 --> 00:59:38,707
Two-component adhesive.
Takes effect after one minute...

712
00:59:38,791 --> 00:59:40,457
Stir,

713
00:59:40,624 --> 00:59:43,165
stir, stir!

714
00:59:50,916 --> 00:59:52,832
See? It works, doesn't it.

715
00:59:53,666 --> 00:59:56,291
You just gotta kick 'em,
bad as that is.

716
00:59:57,874 --> 00:59:59,790
Mhm, nice and spicy.

717
01:00:00,541 --> 01:00:03,332
And, does the gentleman like it now?

718
01:00:05,624 --> 01:00:06,665
Mhm...

719
01:00:12,624 --> 01:00:13,790
What?

720
01:00:16,457 --> 01:00:17,957
You done talking to me?

721
01:00:21,832 --> 01:00:24,332
If you're putting that back
again now, I'm outta here!

722
01:00:26,707 --> 01:00:27,915
You good?

723
01:00:30,374 --> 01:00:31,582
Klaus?

724
01:00:34,957 --> 01:00:35,957
What's up?

725
01:00:39,416 --> 01:00:42,166
Klaus? For God's sake!
For God's sake! Klaus!

726
01:00:44,832 --> 01:00:45,873
Klaus!

727
01:00:52,416 --> 01:00:53,666
For God's sake!

728
01:00:55,874 --> 01:00:57,040
Klaus!

729
01:00:59,457 --> 01:01:00,540
Klaus!

730
01:01:52,499 --> 01:01:55,624
Ahora viene.
He's actually a badass.

731
01:01:55,832 --> 01:01:59,165
Dios mio. He's never done a
damn thing worth mentioning.

732
01:01:59,499 --> 01:02:01,582
<i>Antonio de CoppoIa!</i>

733
01:02:35,166 --> 01:02:36,874
Easy!

734
01:04:23,916 --> 01:04:25,416
Antonio!

735
01:04:26,457 --> 01:04:29,707
Oh, fantastico! Fantastico, fabuloso...

736
01:04:37,291 --> 01:04:39,166
Arrlba...

737
01:04:48,041 --> 01:04:49,957
Here, boys, here's your money.

738
01:04:54,916 --> 01:04:58,291
Yeah. Sick, sick, sick! We got the cash!

739
01:04:58,791 --> 01:05:02,624
10,000 pesete, Tommie,
now we did it!

740
01:05:02,707 --> 01:05:05,415
So cool! Wow!

741
01:05:16,249 --> 01:05:20,165
- Awesome, you also staying at this hotel?
- Nah, nah, we're staying at Playa Mar.

742
01:05:20,249 --> 01:05:23,832
- Ah, that's not bad either. Great.
- What did you just say?

743
01:05:23,916 --> 01:05:26,541
At Playa Mar. That's what she
said at the travel agency.

744
01:05:27,332 --> 01:05:30,332
Tommie! We found our hotel!

745
01:05:31,624 --> 01:05:34,624
- Playa Mar.
- Ah, yes, Playa Mar!

746
01:05:46,916 --> 01:05:49,082
Ey, look: Playa Mar.

747
01:05:50,332 --> 01:05:51,373
Finally, they are here.

748
01:05:54,957 --> 01:05:55,998
Si!

749
01:06:00,791 --> 01:06:04,416
Hey, Mario, it's awesome here.
It looks just like your place.

750
01:06:04,499 --> 01:06:06,582
Si! Picobello.

751
01:06:06,999 --> 01:06:08,249
Eh, good day.

752
01:06:13,332 --> 01:06:15,873
Why you press 4, potato head?

753
01:06:15,957 --> 01:06:19,707
It's written here: 3-0-4!

754
01:06:21,624 --> 01:06:22,707
He!

755
01:06:34,457 --> 01:06:36,332
- Wow!
- Wow!

756
01:06:37,332 --> 01:06:38,498
Cool!

757
01:06:40,332 --> 01:06:44,082
Oh, Tommie, check this out!
Finally a bed.

758
01:06:44,624 --> 01:06:47,499
Dude, awesome, awesome.
Everything here is awesome.

759
01:06:47,582 --> 01:06:49,082
- Hey, look at this!
<i>-</i> What?

760
01:06:50,999 --> 01:06:53,499
Dude, they even have birds here.

761
01:06:57,249 --> 01:06:58,415
Ah...

762
01:07:01,957 --> 01:07:03,123
Tommie!

763
01:07:08,499 --> 01:07:10,665
Room service!

764
01:07:14,999 --> 01:07:16,124
Room service!

765
01:07:23,666 --> 01:07:24,707
Wrong <i>door.</i>

766
01:07:25,541 --> 01:07:27,249
No. This is the right one.

767
01:07:33,332 --> 01:07:34,498
Well, great...

768
01:08:08,874 --> 01:08:11,999
Tomorrow it's finally here.

769
01:08:13,166 --> 01:08:15,207
Ballermann 6.

770
01:08:16,082 --> 01:08:19,915
Drinking out of the
biggest bucket in the world.

771
01:08:20,832 --> 01:08:21,915
Sick!

772
01:08:23,249 --> 01:08:24,290
And?

773
01:08:25,291 --> 01:08:27,749
All the ladies.

774
01:08:29,874 --> 01:08:32,832
Kaleu! Kaleu! Look at this! I've
never seen anything like this in my life.

775
01:08:41,499 --> 01:08:42,665
No!

776
01:08:46,207 --> 01:08:47,873
No!

777
01:08:48,624 --> 01:08:51,540
Alarm! Enemy contact! Alarm!

778
01:08:54,332 --> 01:08:58,165
Now let me ask you this: what are you,
of all people, doing at a Ballermann party?

779
01:08:58,374 --> 01:09:00,124
Oh, just looking around.

780
01:09:01,249 --> 01:09:04,290
- Hola!
<i>-</i> And can you please just stop,

781
01:09:04,332 --> 01:09:07,248
ogling total strangers?
I'm getting sick of this.

782
01:09:07,416 --> 01:09:09,832
I'm sick of it too!
And with you!

783
01:09:16,999 --> 01:09:19,624
Here we go! Here we go!

784
01:09:19,791 --> 01:09:21,999
Hey, Mario, got the cash?

785
01:09:22,082 --> 01:09:23,207
Si!

786
01:09:34,124 --> 01:09:36,165
There, there, there,
there! That's the one, man.

787
01:09:36,457 --> 01:09:39,332
- Ba... Ba... Ba... 6
- Ballermann 6.

788
01:09:39,416 --> 01:09:40,666
And what's it say?

789
01:09:41,124 --> 01:09:43,832
Get rid of that bucket.

790
01:09:43,916 --> 01:09:45,582
Oh!

791
01:09:51,749 --> 01:09:54,874
Tommie, we did it.

792
01:09:56,332 --> 01:09:58,540
Incredible!

793
01:10:02,124 --> 01:10:04,749
Insanely awesome.

794
01:10:04,832 --> 01:10:08,082
Ballermann 6. Fantastico!

795
01:10:08,957 --> 01:10:11,582
<i>-</i> Greedy!
- Hey, you nosy bunch!

796
01:10:12,207 --> 01:10:13,332
We pay here!

797
01:10:32,749 --> 01:10:35,749
Finally some normal people!

798
01:10:41,999 --> 01:10:44,040
Hengst, how ya doing?

799
01:10:57,999 --> 01:11:00,999
- We are not worthy.
- No!

800
01:11:01,374 --> 01:11:05,415
- We are not worthy!
- Now we can die.

801
01:11:05,624 --> 01:11:08,332
We've seen Paradise.

802
01:11:20,291 --> 01:11:22,749
Hey, when can we finally
hit the bucket party?

803
01:11:22,832 --> 01:11:25,498
No panic, dude. Just have
yourself an aperitif first.

804
01:11:31,582 --> 01:11:32,623
Hold on, you monkeys.

805
01:11:41,332 --> 01:11:43,540
What did I tell
you? There they are.

806
01:11:44,957 --> 01:11:46,040
Come on.

807
01:11:46,707 --> 01:11:50,998
Hey, everybody, all ears now!
There she comes. It's finally here!

808
01:11:51,082 --> 01:11:54,082
The great sauerkraut battle!

809
01:11:54,207 --> 01:11:57,040
And I still need two loudmouths

810
01:11:57,124 --> 01:11:59,332
who simply can't get enough.

811
01:11:59,916 --> 01:12:02,332
Where are they? Who's winning?

812
01:12:02,416 --> 01:12:06,916
The winner gets to be the first to dive
into the biggest sangria bucket in the world!

813
01:12:08,124 --> 01:12:10,207
You can do me a little
favor, if you please.

814
01:12:10,291 --> 01:12:13,082
See? Those two complete idiots
down there, they are absolutely starving.

815
01:12:15,124 --> 01:12:17,790
Hey, I have found two,
two wonderful boys.

816
01:12:17,874 --> 01:12:22,374
Two fine fellows,
and you two are in.

817
01:12:23,207 --> 01:12:26,957
Sauerkraut! Sauerkraut! Sauerkraut!

818
01:12:28,707 --> 01:12:29,748
So, guys...

819
01:12:29,791 --> 01:12:33,166
...and now I'm gonna drop
way down to your level for a sec.

820
01:12:41,041 --> 01:12:42,291
Oh...

821
01:12:45,707 --> 01:12:47,040
- Get lost!
- Yikes!

822
01:12:48,957 --> 01:12:52,707
Sauerkraut! Sauerkraut! Sauerkraut!

823
01:12:58,124 --> 01:13:01,124
Uh... Oh! Check out that one over there!

824
01:13:09,082 --> 01:13:11,915
There's no way, they
were literally just here.

825
01:13:13,916 --> 01:13:16,541
Hey, guys, get over here,
come on, come on, come on.

826
01:13:16,791 --> 01:13:20,332
You guys can do some cleanup,
come on. Take 'em down, boys!

827
01:13:20,874 --> 01:13:23,457
- We're gonna take 'em, right?
- On your marks...

828
01:13:23,541 --> 01:13:27,207
get set... go!

829
01:13:27,332 --> 01:13:29,248
Damn. That's a real shame.

830
01:13:36,624 --> 01:13:38,499
Yeah, give 'em everything!
Lick 'em off.

831
01:13:39,541 --> 01:13:41,166
Yeah, make her freak!

832
01:13:44,749 --> 01:13:48,082
- Come on, let's find one for ourselves too.
- But it's gotta be a hot one!

833
01:13:52,916 --> 01:13:56,041
He's getting a smooch
first, just you wait!

834
01:13:57,249 --> 01:14:00,374
Ah… we're not good enough for him!

835
01:14:01,707 --> 01:14:04,040
Stop it! Everyone, stop!

836
01:14:04,124 --> 01:14:05,415
Stop it!

837
01:14:13,957 --> 01:14:15,040
Tacky.

838
01:14:16,957 --> 01:14:18,582
Just plain tacky.

839
01:14:18,916 --> 01:14:23,416
Everything in position. The biggest
bucket of sangria in the world!

840
01:14:33,541 --> 01:14:35,999
- Here! See?
- Well, who do we have here?

841
01:14:40,666 --> 01:14:43,374
- Kaddi, over there! That's the canister.
- What?

842
01:14:43,457 --> 01:14:44,498
There.

843
01:15:00,291 --> 01:15:03,291
Hey, come on, that's not a thing!

844
01:15:09,041 --> 01:15:12,166
- Yuck!
- Anni, you got any suncream?

845
01:15:12,749 --> 01:15:15,374
- Right there!
- Thanks!

846
01:15:20,082 --> 01:15:23,332
Maria, Sangria,

847
01:15:23,416 --> 01:15:26,124
<i>-</i> Mailore…
- Ahhhhh!

848
01:15:33,082 --> 01:15:35,790
Oh, ouch, damn it!

849
01:15:45,541 --> 01:15:47,499
Oh, come on, this is not happening!

850
01:15:58,624 --> 01:16:03,124
Now it's time, now
it's time, now it's time…

851
01:16:12,374 --> 01:16:14,749
Let's go, let's go, babies!

852
01:16:15,332 --> 01:16:19,248
Delicious! Free drinks!

853
01:16:19,916 --> 01:16:23,916
Now we're off
with our Ballermann girls!

854
01:16:26,707 --> 01:16:30,457
Now we're off,
hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

855
01:16:40,457 --> 01:16:43,457
Ole, ole, ole, ole...

856
01:16:43,707 --> 01:16:46,415
ole, ole...

857
01:16:53,624 --> 01:16:55,999
- Ouch!
- Very funny.

858
01:16:58,541 --> 01:17:01,541
Ole, ole, ole, ole...

859
01:17:06,832 --> 01:17:09,290
Ole, ole...

860
01:17:09,624 --> 01:17:12,749
Ole, ole, ole, ole...

861
01:17:13,041 --> 01:17:16,249
Ole, ole...

862
01:17:21,291 --> 01:17:24,791
- All I'm getting is air?!
- Where's a straw around here?

863
01:17:57,957 --> 01:17:59,123
Easy!

864
01:18:00,124 --> 01:18:01,457
Not so easy!

865
01:18:04,541 --> 01:18:06,416
That's a Ballermann ban, straight up!

866
01:18:28,624 --> 01:18:29,749
There!

867
01:18:43,374 --> 01:18:45,040
Oh!

868
01:19:20,457 --> 01:19:23,790
Tommie! Look at her, being such a dork.

869
01:19:25,916 --> 01:19:29,707
We always get lucky. We
can do whatever we want.

870
01:19:30,291 --> 01:19:31,416
Come on!

871
01:19:59,957 --> 01:20:02,457
Cologne is about to blow
up and Bergheim's laughing.

872
01:20:03,332 --> 01:20:05,957
Better than the best
Swedish cocktail, right?

873
01:20:09,541 --> 01:20:10,582
Easy!

874
01:20:13,207 --> 01:20:16,790
Oh, Mama!

875
01:20:33,999 --> 01:20:36,165
Hey, what a killer holiday, hey!

876
01:20:36,249 --> 01:20:38,832
Hey, so greedy, hey,
stoked, stoked, stoked!

877
01:20:38,916 --> 01:20:42,499
Hey, we scored it all,
hey, we nabbed it all, hey!

878
01:20:42,624 --> 01:20:46,082
Sì! Even a bullfight, we
have seen for free, we did.

879
01:20:47,916 --> 01:20:50,041
Tommie. Tommie, wait, wait!

880
01:20:50,249 --> 01:20:52,582
Maja! Maja! Maja! Maja!

881
01:20:52,749 --> 01:20:53,874
Hey, watch out!

882
01:20:54,332 --> 01:20:58,207
- Hey, Maja!
- For God's sake, what have you guys done?

883
01:20:58,291 --> 01:20:59,957
Nada, nada, we're all good again.

884
01:21:01,291 --> 01:21:04,374
You're on your own?
Where's your stupid friend?

885
01:21:04,457 --> 01:21:06,498
That's a thing of the past.
I'm heading back home.

886
01:21:06,541 --> 01:21:07,541
Eh, where to?

887
01:21:07,624 --> 01:21:08,665
To Düsseldorf.

888
01:21:09,999 --> 01:21:11,165
Düsseldorf, huh?

889
01:21:11,874 --> 01:21:13,874
Where exactly do you live there?

890
01:21:15,249 --> 01:21:16,874
Well, it's in, <i>um...</i>

891
01:21:18,166 --> 01:21:19,582
It's in, uh...

892
01:21:24,291 --> 01:21:25,957
Anyway, bye, guys!

893
01:21:34,916 --> 01:21:38,457
Such a great girl, and off she goes...

894
01:21:39,249 --> 01:21:41,124
Whatever, we've
already had them.

895
01:21:42,207 --> 01:21:45,665
Si! We get everything we want.

896
01:21:47,207 --> 01:21:48,873
Ouch!

897
01:21:54,707 --> 01:21:59,207
This vacation was the
best time in my whole life.

898
01:22:00,041 --> 01:22:02,791
We drank it all dry, everything.

899
01:22:03,041 --> 01:22:05,999
Super! I just can't figure out why people

900
01:22:06,832 --> 01:22:10,207
go on vacation
where there isn't even a bucket?

901
01:22:11,332 --> 01:22:13,915
Those people are so dumb.

902
01:22:13,999 --> 01:22:15,165
Seriously.

903
01:22:24,207 --> 01:22:26,832
Hey, Tommie, that's the one over there!

904
01:22:27,916 --> 01:22:29,582
Right, right!

905
01:22:30,041 --> 01:22:32,291
The one we totally
fixed up for him.

906
01:22:50,916 --> 01:22:52,291
Allah!

907
01:22:53,666 --> 01:22:54,749
Hey!

908
01:22:56,082 --> 01:22:59,290
Si! It's him! Buon giorno, amigo!

909
01:22:59,374 --> 01:23:01,207
Man, wasn't that a trip?

910
01:23:02,332 --> 01:23:05,665
<i>-</i> Oh!
<i>-</i> But hey, why'd you just stand there?

911
01:23:06,124 --> 01:23:09,749
Hey, you're in the wrong spot. You gotta
take that thing back where you got it from.

912
01:23:09,832 --> 01:23:13,207
But, Tommie, he broke it.

913
01:23:13,749 --> 01:23:16,415
Nah! You just gotta press
that button over there!

914
01:23:16,416 --> 01:23:17,791
- No!
- Yes!

915
01:23:29,749 --> 01:23:32,207
You should always help people...

916
01:23:32,666 --> 01:23:36,166
Si. Everyone. Just like us.

917
01:23:36,666 --> 01:23:40,082
Then it'd really be better
for the whole world.

918
01:23:45,416 --> 01:23:46,957
Easy!

